#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:5
#: 21ea791ecab44987b526dc20b8ea6773 6e3d63ea3fe041b58e3e4a83da0dfa30
#: 71b6b70a79a94a2892093542291837f7 c36bd610b67c43659deb7a2d750bc510
#: ecba5d30bb6946bcbbbd13326e63a546
msgid "Archived:Edge Quick Start"
msgstr "已归档：Edge 快速入门"

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:8
#: 080e3772fc624e6896e1167cf2906c35 356afecafaec4a9782ea5b56a05ffc58
#: 392491d77d3f4f2aacbf3cf728c7e1c7 4138b391448f4168b1621cb27a3d37e0
#: 8871327c379143cc935cb25ad96608aa
msgid ""
"This quickstart tutorial will guide you through the initial setup of Edge "
"drone controller and its accessories. In the end you’ll get a configured "
"Edge drone controller that streams video from a camera to your laptop. After"
" that you can proceed to the hardware installation guide and install your "
"Edge in a frame."
msgstr ""
"本快速入门教程将引导您完成 Edge 无人机控制器及其配件的初始设置。完成后，您将得到一个配置好的 Edge "
"无人机控制器，可将摄像头的视频流传输到您的笔记本电脑。之后您可以继续阅读硬件安装指南，将 Edge 安装到机架上。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:18
#: 2b31ed1b7ccf444abb9fcf52166cda8f 379f183754f346aaa52d26ac87101a6c
#: 3b69bd9551914482aef286fa7c35326b 43e085152f9546bda4a9253525854d2b
#: 50f1520cc9bf4334a793b64d7e9872d2
msgid ""
"Please update Edge to the latest `firmware "
"<https://docs.emlid.com/edge/firmware-update/>`__  before continuing."
msgstr ""
"继续操作前，请将 Edge 更新到最新 `固件 <https://docs.emlid.com/edge/firmware-update/>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:22
#: 1ff00104aa174df2b3fe66ff12ec8772 2a47ed7c3d7f49659019765503cafede
#: 53af4445d48a4624a4edad63f69a8129 9bf07382305d4c689f281a59de09d1fc
#: fd0c73bc763544159bce916b83d7599d
msgid ""
"If you encounter any issues performing these steps, we are happy to help you"
" out on our `community forum <http://community.emlid.com/>`__ ."
msgstr ""
"如果您在执行这些步骤时遇到任何问题，欢迎在我们的 `社区论坛 <http://community.emlid.com/>`__ 上寻求帮助。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:27
#: 2667291724ef4ed2bd0ae5337452157f 510ed95826cf434aa994642c58c95389
#: 5fb9120a91e2495094c41504bd315c7a 84fcec2fe4a64adf8f0105818500cbc8
#: eb870d4ecd994a2abe1c7fa190d9a60d
msgid "Connect Edge GNSS module"
msgstr "连接 Edge GNSS 模块"

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:29
#: 15eeefc3a169467686bb81c7d2db7a49 874e2a936ee941979814f732cfe9eaa7
#: aaede9cb2e764b7f828631f6a57b10a0 af954fa69b2e4bac996c5b5e72db79f3
#: ff26487fa16f4f82a17e484661b04982
msgid ""
"Edge GNSS module is a positioning device that contains a GNSS receiver, a "
"high-precision barometer and two 3-axis compasses."
msgstr "Edge GNSS 模块是一款定位设备，包含 GNSS 接收机、高精度气压计和两个三轴罗盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:31
#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:33
#: 48d11878baf04ee0918c4b97989519e6 55fa6497faad435aa54996bd6bb757a0
#: 75bdf5fc077546b69a855124e6c098a5 cee2d59969f54d0cb4b000cd55e1201a
#: fc5f675bc3134b33b521e04f5e822f54
msgid ""
"To connect Edge GNSS module to Edge use a JST-GH-4P to JST-GH-4P cable."
msgstr "使用 JST-GH-4P 转 JST-GH-4P 线缆将 Edge GNSS 模块连接到 Edge。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:32
#: 3b322a3d919146f88c017447f1016519 6f5f7459773f4517b0d026d240035c29
#: 852dd52a6baf43388de4662ba3725d51 9c9560c247de4490b7ff9618494097cc
#: 9cd3fa729c6542d3bc2537b614adde9e
msgid ""
"Connect one end of the cable to any of the CAN ports on Edge GNSS module"
msgstr "将线缆一端连接到 Edge GNSS 模块上任意一个 CAN 接口"

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:33
#: 13e29deed1b845f096098f969c71ebb4 1456c1327bdf48f1a4dc6c837d0fa61c
#: 1cdc24c245a04e6080f8379ee2279abe aa9f858728ca478da75fc64485db071e
#: d0f965220ebd44ca97634102992bc034
msgid ""
"Connect another end of the cable to any of the CAN ports of Edge drone "
"controller"
msgstr "将线缆另一端连接到 Edge 无人机控制器上任意一个 CAN 接口"

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:41
#: 13753530a7de44b2b32be163c9b75c79 5d5f2325622546be83ca0cd88a9039ce
#: 80250b22dc6c4bfc91eb4d38dcdb6f8b c834f042226c48c7803bbebaed25f20e
#: e501daab192741a0a49fdd60d3b20245
msgid "Connect video camera"
msgstr "连接摄像头"

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:43
#: 0ec9a0561f4c4ac3b53f67114e7b86f3 3df118eb8de1483aa9c6b739138a0bfa
#: 6b66b7b4072847e2944213476db511a2 f0b9eee1cc29427bb3116a5ef4f8ac8d
#: f12b7c931ee8415eb69e4784690ec07f
msgid ""
"Camera should be connected to the HDMI-IN port on Edge. In case you are "
"connecting an action camera then most likely it will have Micro-HDMI "
"connector as well. In that case you would need Micro-HDMI to Micro-HDMI "
"cable to connect the camera to the Edge."
msgstr ""
"摄像头应连接到 Edge 的 HDMI-IN 接口。如果您连接的是运动相机，则其很可能也有 Micro-HDMI 接口。此时需要 Micro-HDMI "
"转 Micro-HDMI 线缆将相机连接到 Edge。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:50
#: 16385a49eab041fa8af044dab01b510b 598f212a8df8443a803f96785dd3385d
#: 79979f40b68a47b78d1d3c137afbd977 8c6ba6316550424f9046f4728d5fd2aa
#: eaa910ae6883455e85f40d70fe18f0e2
msgid ""
"Turn off the camera’s internal WiFi, otherwise it may interfere with RC "
"equipment or Wi-Fi modules"
msgstr "关闭相机内置的 WiFi，否则可能会干扰遥控设备或 Wi-Fi 模块"

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:53
#: 0449d3484ca647ac9f98267c10c6a6ce 2e78ab16f30141fbbda602eeda32f162
#: 5e42057c738744eaa5157db45b912aa5 b8d4d3053f9b4bb2aa0659413f432fdd
#: d74071cd83dd453fb00b35a5571e1ced
msgid ""
"Turn the camera on after Edge is `booted <https://docs.emlid.com/edge/led-"
"status/>`__."
msgstr "Edge `启动 <https://docs.emlid.com/edge/led-status/>`__ 后再开启相机。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:56
#: 048021891f004186a67f1aafa5dc034f 2ab489ae83934d5eba0e7dc5bb68bc13
#: 2feeb094551643a7abb2d11948c53021 555f6aefc6a94de69f3628669371491c
#: 977a555a1ace4f418468bb6416176634
msgid ""
"Resolution and frame per second value of the input stream may vary. Maximum "
"supported video format is 1080p 30fps."
msgstr "输入视频流的分辨率和帧率可能有所不同。支持的最大视频格式为 1080p 30fps。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:61
#: 174b86912bf24ffbb27453df9af64fef 619efe2a59b44cb897113470fb865c99
#: d1474f3abd434edab47b18907ba00ed8 e39d43a0de5f484f9628e3db254ea27a
#: e8256726cb6a4dc8a4ec178ce36908a2
msgid "Connect Wi-Fi modules"
msgstr "连接 Wi-Fi 模块"

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:63
#: 073fb20132ff4000b8a9543765c5c0f8 1179f7ec44d74df7856325becfc0109c
#: 42c14133f55c4e20b4b8c6c282bb4358 7e6f82d5efbe48f1a44c8b2427a24278
#: bdbb43f779d6425583051277287674b9
msgid ""
"Edge kit comes with two identical long-range Wi-Fi modules in separate "
"boxes. Use one to connect to the Edge drone controller and another one to "
"connect to a computer (assuming a laptop for rest of the guide)."
msgstr ""
"Edge 套装包含两个独立包装的相同长距离 Wi-Fi 模块。一个用于连接 Edge "
"无人机控制器，另一个用于连接计算机（本指南其余部分假设使用笔记本电脑）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:67
#: 04ee78a0d6114dc38358776e72759373 4025a0dc40124c02ab3eb6e95820c424
#: a367a3715b274fa082a9a72535f562df db8771fb0c03494c87c0fce636bcca1e
#: e24b72d1257a495b9dacea5ea3cf32c7
msgid "Connect Wi-Fi module to Edge"
msgstr "将 Wi-Fi 模块连接到 Edge"

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:72
#: 0bddb3ae49b5466489bce49dae4d2171 2ba7730b33f74dad8c6b1f7d9ced8325
#: 7d78b9c69eb64289a9c61be02389aa63 97d1dcee26c04563a96c57c75f2b17ed
#: f9167a480dc844aea92d3caa9b209874
msgid ""
"To connect Wi-Fi module to the Edge use a Micro-USB to JSH-GH-4P cable from "
"the kit."
msgstr "使用套装中的 Micro-USB 转 JST-GH-4P 线缆将 Wi-Fi 模块连接到 Edge。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:74
#: 2569218753d94d4789ace4f7d40f247b 46365fa546434cc7879ef3b6b6fa76bd
#: 56e639d457a54c779910940fb0abdf96 c75152720ee449f988fb0098f65e210d
#: d9f7d24a666f4d3f94e94500bff25045
msgid "Plug JST-GH-4P connector into Edge port labeled USB2"
msgstr "将 JST-GH-4P 连接器插入 Edge 上标记为 USB2 的接口"

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:75
#: 1a384671ecac419f97b1b959328192ea aaedf73597464fae987c51b7cae9306c
#: bbf12fa0ce594c6e9ecc5806e37b79f9 ef72db329173400c9825dc47f1cc8b4d
#: f65024abd4e843e8a5334c66e58e6f76
msgid "Plug Micro-USB connector into Micro-USB port of the Wi-Fi module"
msgstr "将 Micro-USB 连接器插入 Wi-Fi 模块的 Micro-USB 接口"

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:79
#: 44b4fb0484f1415c82b03ade03561db8 6734e317e27f4f09b1c29e190c9b16aa
#: 9314e703b1c74d69b5185e58f84fbf97 acadabdaa38e4661a2319b5ff4aa41df
#: c75b64db33fc4a859786f6604ac29507
msgid "Connect Wi-Fi module to a computer"
msgstr "将 Wi-Fi 模块连接到计算机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:85
#: 61d9b66e53984e4c888183559d7d7ba3 8d93a4a6d2274418bbd6d06e722caa34
#: 904f6b9365a241b5b28d5a712629e183 d6a2deb9e03b4270b77a336aa749c2aa
#: e3fb54fb3cd84b44aaed375c2603d8d7
msgid ""
"We need to connect another Wi-Fi module to the laptop. In order to do that "
"you need to perform two simple steps"
msgstr "我们需要将另一个 Wi-Fi 模块连接到笔记本电脑。只需执行两个简单步骤"

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:87
#: 17a9acc0d2a94a3f82b91521e6e1f441 3bee78f660054d02b769c440ce6b1f94
#: 87648090e0b64c1a877e5c5f662375dc b4484f6e615145d9b66cdbd8a94d0e32
#: f173ef4c78c74e288d8fc6d3022f2c11
msgid "Use Alfa’s Micro-USB-3.0 to USB-3.0 cable from the Wi-Fi module box"
msgstr "使用 Wi-Fi 模块盒中的 Alfa Micro-USB-3.0 转 USB-3.0 线缆"

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:89
#: 0bfe3750447b457997c84572c65e8dc8 4d995f6fe36841b39ebacbbef9559a9c
#: d93f804f9a954a11b9720d8b52461180 df052d0f997246ccb9e25da66ab5ce4b
#: ec87075ce6ff4d439c35c56447ebf415
msgid "Connect Micro-USB-3.0 one end of the cable to the Wi-Fi module"
msgstr "将线缆的 Micro-USB-3.0 一端连接到 Wi-Fi 模块"

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:90
#: 148468e73311406b801b2d8a2e6903ab 2e0baa9b305a4bb79dc9e9c649540af7
#: 33791abcdb2d4c44b2756889e449fb7a 4d80766be8d248c1acffe418b60ad431
#: ad12c3184f104ead966ae9c9daca2c24
msgid "Connect the other end to the USB port of your laptop/desktop computer"
msgstr "将另一端连接到笔记本/台式电脑的 USB 接口"

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:94
#: 065c67ae953f45ee80d7f047dacea6c5 742799b1a478472cbf5718850570fb44
#: a5183658f9a34605ba487c1503cfd48d cca9a09e52654aada5be4d0233cc7324
#: ebf6d08f84b24d52b8b627a5bb1da5f8
msgid "Software installation"
msgstr "软件安装"

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:96
#: 1fcb1455d8c544b2afe26c030ef5ba79 3fc33c6aa7b849258cea4eb2ca6daf04
#: b460daef0f164a3d9e2be572f05038bc c39ddbd6041d4827ad7738b6e13bf404
#: db45dd7b2ee940e6b6011b67de0414b7
msgid ""
"Now we need to install the driver for the Wi-Fi module. The instructions "
"depend on your OS. Please, proceed to the "
"`<https://docs.emlid.com/edge/quickstart/#software-installation>`__ for the "
"detailed instructions."
msgstr ""
"现在我们需要安装 Wi-Fi 模块的驱动程序。具体步骤取决于您的操作系统。详细说明请参见 "
"`<https://docs.emlid.com/edge/quickstart/#software-installation>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:102
#: 4bb78cc16efc4a0383a8dbf46018be51 6e22c4c9da1f4473a2bed60dde5fb365
#: c8596f6cb0204b1b85fc514f37b8f732 eefdf14512614d98b1d01c3a4b09ab13
#: f62e828deb2247269af934a55ceedfd4
msgid "Power from a battery"
msgstr "电池供电"

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:104
#: 2a2b029b51ac4c0e877767c355068b77 ae56d6cdb689454d822104f91d4626fa
#: c082784f6b1c44d490e07971753c16ac c4289a9c5f3b441c825fa42d40a25a76
#: ceb7946f5d39434ca9e9b5ff559cd5a9
msgid "Now you can turn on your Edge using the Edge Power Module (PM)."
msgstr "现在可以使用 Edge 电源模块（PM）开启 Edge。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:106
#: 17d376689acf491aab7b18e3e58a9be3 2c6bac9aad754c099673c0b193623207
#: 317c06afcd924626a0b910e724e42311 54fc52d8bb5b4c63a6c5c542686b79ad
#: 943957c65b8441daa8a5ffc862b56038
msgid "Connect JST-GH-6P connector to any power port on Edge (PWR1 or PWR2)."
msgstr "将 JST-GH-6P 连接器插入 Edge 上任意电源接口（PWR1 或 PWR2）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:111
#: 673e477e6f1d4ccdbbb98768ab685b55 a842239a341c42c297c8bc2a6e188b4d
#: c2cd0bd1223140d09216b41ce25585aa cb0526bd94ab4af2871151b664920220
#: dbde15cf6b37406d927832ebc7ccb1cb
msgid "And after that connect a battery to your PM."
msgstr "然后将电池连接到电源模块。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:119
#: 4ba100e20c9449c0a039c3f658847984 caca33576c264ad383a6c0a7c16bf4ef
#: cff7b5a4d6884eeb9f2f79ab90bbe370 d9347204780d4d20bc554f891bfdc9b9
#: f286131879a04d3392706650dd80ce66
msgid "Connect to Edge’s access point"
msgstr "连接到 Edge 热点"

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:121
#: 0ed6b87cae9e44b0ae17d45a5dbb3722 7207daf188cf4fc981a4b238854fa0ce
#: 96c78e67019c463a932cea219a37ed5a b30136a3d11e40caa275f4e5c440f0ea
#: c5b4ede14b1949d9a84515184d2c5461
msgid ""
"After powering up Edge needs some time to create an access point (AP). "
"Connect to Edge’s AP (edge) with password: EmlidEdge (since 1.2 the password"
" will be emlidedge)."
msgstr ""
"Edge 上电后需要一段时间来创建热点（AP）。连接到 Edge 的 AP（edge），密码：EmlidEdge（从 1.2 版本起密码改为 "
"emlidedge）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:124
#: 51179f63332a4cab9fbf1edcb25d3045 6863ff4278db4da88ef3ee16f147470d
#: b94010b2a7c7421c8c17cc0a789de164 be530579dee54bbebc4f93eeeb02f714
#: f776eca376c54aa2914ba0fea4e0cc54
msgid ""
"Most laptops have a built-in Wi-Fi module. You need to connect to Edge using"
" specifically the external Wi-Fi module provided with Edge."
msgstr "大多数笔记本电脑内置 Wi-Fi 模块。您需要专门使用 Edge 附带的外置 Wi-Fi 模块连接到 Edge。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:131
#: 44dde54b2a6b44cbbdb230a5ca8ceabe 79b3f444612144d5a2e0c3469499cbf7
#: 88e0ca7866cd462a9e089b222ba99f1e 8a0c40e01e85424ebcc78a365004ec6e
#: ac25bd72bae8451989459ae87a47dbb4
msgid ""
"To avoid interference from the internal Wi-Fi we recommend disabling it."
msgstr "为避免内置 Wi-Fi 的干扰，建议将其禁用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:134
#: 338511f60a3541158a320d47de076b9c 5214143357914ac591d6660cfea4a4bc
#: 5c8c643b852f4af7863b32fa0b356aae ac7ddafb28404061bf7a1aadf47d045b
#: e101a9d578254adca86ce98cff1907f7
msgid ""
"Be sure you connect to AP using the external Wi-Fi module, not the built-in "
"Wi-Fi module of your laptop After the connection succeeded you can run the "
"QGC."
msgstr "确保您使用外置 Wi-Fi 模块而非笔记本内置 Wi-Fi 连接到 AP。连接成功后即可运行 QGC。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:139
#: 134a5c6d9e1746c7a2569c5d89c24e1e 7969559587f94fb4ae145f02d1526819
#: 84de9189022a4711af748db9b27cc29f ac98f70c1ba34a8788d6cbd16983ac1a
#: cd6c18ab348741aeb2d1f665e2b606e7
msgid "Configuring QGroundControl for Edge"
msgstr "为 Edge 配置 QGroundControl"

#: ../../source/docs/common-edge-quick-start.rst:141
#: 00b35aced13c46a6a0cf7c57998bc945 19319d645ae644578694a3477331abd7
#: 3325bbc7bcf640519117134b210082c2 aedb6df7782445ae9b9d6dd7108c8988
#: d255a2e540a34245af1c3f4daac08951
msgid ""
"Detailed instructions are available `here "
"<https://docs.emlid.com/edge/quickstart/#configuring-qgroundcontrol-for-"
"edge>`__."
msgstr ""
"详细说明请参见 `此处 <https://docs.emlid.com/edge/quickstart/#configuring-"
"qgroundcontrol-for-edge>`__。"
